{"product_id":"vaporesso-gtx-series-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso GTX Series Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn one simple GTX Pod you get all these features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecure magnetic connection - don’t worry about the GTX Pod popping off accidentally.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBig clouds and delicious flavour from your e-liquid with Vaporesso GTX Coils.\u003cbr\u003eQuick fire.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop fill - simple quarter turn of top cap through silicone-covered port hole.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS leak-resistant technology in the pod which stands for: seal comprehensively with the o-rings that keep the air pressure in for a tighter draw store safely with extra seal that may prevent leaking while not in use saturate properly via the large coil openings to the cotton to avoid burning the coil or getting a dry hit (aka helps prime coil and keep the cotton wet while vaping).\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick coil change - simply pull the old coil out and plug in the new one\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable airflow - tighten or loosen your air intake. Perfect for direct-lung (DL) vaping (where you inhale vapour directly to the lungs from the drip tip)!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso GTX Pod 26 5 ml (TPD)\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso GTX Pod 22 3.5 ml (TPD)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe GTX 22 pod is 39.5 mm in height and 22.5 mm in diameter.\u003cbr\u003eThe GTX 26 pod is 40.5 mm in height and 26 mm in diameter.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGTX Pod 22 is designed for use in the Vaporesso GTX 40 Pod kit.\u003cbr\u003eGTX Pod 26 is designed for use in the Vaporesso GTX 80 Pod kit and Target 80 kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX replacement pods are recommended for use with both High VG 70+ (DTL), 50\/50 Freebase (MTL) and Nic Salt (MTL) E-Liquids.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"GTX 22 3.5ML","offer_id":41775207448631,"sku":"V GTX Series Replace Pods GTX 22 3.5 ml","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"GTX 26 5ML","offer_id":41775207481399,"sku":"V GTX Series Replace Pods GTX 26 5 ml","price":1950.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752511690","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-series-replacement-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




